{"parse": {"title": "顿悟之声", "pageid": 88405, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"顿悟之声\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d5/Item-489092.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"顿悟之声\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>顿悟之声</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>4#489092</div></div><hr /><div>一只石质的铃铛。使用后可使一名5星或5星以下角色的等级提升至洞悉2层1级。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">在无人看向这只铃铛时，那被雕于其上的眼睛，会极其缓慢地眨动。它仍在思索它所见的一切，直至它晃动着，意欲迎向风中那一瞬的灵思。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "顿悟之声"}}